# Takeout bag (issue 154): a plain cream paper bag seen near top-down, ink outline, the top folded over with a crease and two staples, a tan right side and a soft grease spot. Lighter than the floor and the package box so it reads at a glance. No print, no logo, no text. 1x1 tile; sits on the floor in front of the front door, in place of the package box, only while a takeout meal waits and no package does.
size: 16x16
